{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0033_1000_045kar", "source_sha256": "9cdaf19fc76b0231f40b6986850f3766889a1faad80401a9891e8020465ba4f2", "ja": "あ、あの、{$P$}さん……。\n今……お仕事中、ですか……？", "zh": "请、请问，{$P$}先生……\n你现在……在工作吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0033_1001_p", "source_sha256": "b691824158e99a1d022712bb279cade90682b68381216ee88c71989ce7792e88", "ja": "今は平気だけど……どうかしたのか？", "zh": "现在是不忙……怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0033_1002_045kar", "source_sha256": "0f92b9a776939acce5510335fd5147015070cb80a311fb36e1cb6f38b55f2eb3", "ja": "ええと……い、いつも、お世話になっているので……\n今日はお礼に……お、贈り物を、持って来ました……。", "zh": "呃……因、因为平时总是受你照顾……\n为了表达谢意……我、我今天带了礼物……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0033_1003_p", "source_sha256": "932d20b3fda30d8560764cbdeac24b9351f100667f84393d2ee8dd0c73d9ba68", "ja": "そんな気を遣わなくても……。プロデューサーの俺が\n可憐を助けるのは、当たり前だろ？", "zh": "用不着这么费心啦……我身为制作人，\n帮助可怜也是理所当然的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0033_1004_045kar", "source_sha256": "d257d6f8ebc6748c2665b6988d621e7c674c02e7fd6f4302fd1a96b795453877", "ja": "で、でも……最近ずっと、練習に付き合ったり、\n相談に乗ってもらったりしてたので……。", "zh": "可、可是……最近总是请你陪我练习\n或商量事情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0033_1005_045kar", "source_sha256": "f8f1661de098c76a48ef0af5116ea2a171e00912ca5966ef9a67a1cbf3be98c3", "ja": "{$P$}さん、疲れてるんじゃないかと\n思って……あ、アロマを、選んできたんです……。", "zh": "我想说{$P$}先生或许很累……\n就、就去挑了香氛精油……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0033_1006_045kar", "source_sha256": "44a5f2027ab1e831e3406133eca361e623cdb6bac6c5bff7c845f7ecf8af9960", "ja": "よかったら、今……つ、使ってみませんか……？\nディフューザーも、用意しましたから……。", "zh": "不嫌弃的话，要不要……现、现在就用用看……？\n我也准备了喷雾机……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0033_1007_045kar", "source_sha256": "c06024202aa50a235e72ee7d3cc7a81cbc5502ee49db5e92b8486829562a7a2a", "ja": "えっと……ど、どうですか……？", "zh": "那个……怎、怎么样呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0033_1008_p", "source_sha256": "e60e7acf558a70403e7de0fb3b5f8f8d963cd7b85aa5093ea19ba23b3a386ac1", "ja": "これは、グレープフルーツの香りか……？\nさわやかで、いい匂いだな。", "zh": "这是葡萄柚的香味吗……？\n好清香的味道。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0033_1009_045kar", "source_sha256": "c609851914230862fc7c8d42f735f041e779d505b8aab98cd41322ee41d06c2b", "ja": "は、はい……ベルガモットと、グレープフルーツです。\n柑橘系の香りで、スッキリしてもらえたらって……。", "zh": "是、是啊……这是香柑和葡萄柚。\n希望柑橘类的香味能让你感到神清气爽……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0033_1010_p", "source_sha256": "c228d5c92288206d802e4de13b6d82effd8dbaedc59f4c6560fbff6ffb04c32c", "ja": "うん、気に入ったよ。ありがとう。\nこれなら、仕事にもグッと集中できそうだ。", "zh": "嗯，我很喜欢喔，谢谢你。\n这样一来，我应该可以更专心工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0033_1011_045kar", "source_sha256": "30e787e50d14c09445658ac7c70c65fab7a06de8912cbf839bf3f38d6ad00d18", "ja": "お、お役に立てたみたいで、よかった……。\nえへへ……♪", "zh": "看、看来有帮到你的忙，太好了……\n嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
